# Keep secrets and bulk out of the build context entirely.
# The agent Dockerfile uses explicit COPY paths, so nothing here is in the
# image today -- this exists so that stays true if someone later writes
# `COPY . .`, and so credentials are never even sent to the Docker daemon.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*

.git
.gitignore
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.pytest_cache
**/media
**/media_test
**/*.log
.superpowers
docs
frontend
